OL,3,GNEWSAYour guide to Coventry and
OL,4,AWarwickshire Christmas events
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoventry will not have a Christmas
OL,7,Flights switch-on event this year, as
OL,8,Fthe city is to again host a festive
OL,9,Fmarket and a "Festival of Christmas"
OL,10,Finstead.
OL,12,FSo what can people expect to enjoy in
OL,13,Fthe run up to the festivities in the
OL,14,Fcity and across Warwickshire?
OL,16,FThe Christmas market will open on
OL,17,FFriday 13 November.
OL,19,FIt will start trading at 17:00 GMT and
OL,20,Fthe big wheel will be ready to ride,
OL,21,Fthough the market will not operate on
OL,22,FChristmas Day and New Year's Day.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
